+# Contributor PR Flow Uses Dated Feature Chore Fix Branches
+
+## Context
+
+The contributor branch-and-PR helper was added as a repo-local script at `scripts/pr_flow.py`.
+
+The accepted branch-name formats are:
+
+- `feature/YYYY_MM_DD_description`
+- `chore/YYYY_MM_DD_description`
+- `fix/YYYY_MM_DD_description`
+
+The helper creates branches from an up-to-date `main`, refuses to open pull requests from `main`,
+pushes only valid topic branches, and switches back to `main` after the pull request is merged.
+
+## Reuse Assessment
+
+Use this when editing contributor workflow docs, tests, or helper behavior.
+
+The existing `ai-wiki/workflows.md` branch flow still contains older examples such as `feat/...` and
+`docs/...`. Treat those examples as stale for this helper until a human confirms whether the
+user-owned workflow doc should be updated.
+
+## Related Files
+
+- `CONTRIBUTING.md`
+- `scripts/pr_flow.py`
+- `tests/test_pr_flow.py`
+- `ai-wiki/workflows.md`
